iv class=3D"style_problemDescription__T4cPe"><p>Given a set of points on a =
plane, determine the <strong>minimum cost to connect all these points</stro=
ng>.</p><p>The cost of connecting two points is equal to the <strong>Manhat=
tan distance</strong> between them, which is calculated as <code>|x1 - x2| =
+ |y1 - y2|</code> for two points <code>(x1, y1)</code> and <code>(x2, y2)<=
/code>.</p><h4 id=3D"example">Example:</h4><figure class=3D"py-1"><div styl=
